1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,359
BioPilot Bench helps researchers review

2
00:00:02,359 --> 00:00:04,839
protein variants with traceable evidence.

3
00:00:04,839 --> 00:00:07,221
Here are nineteen saved Lipase A

4
00:00:07,221 --> 00:00:10,645
candidates and their ESM sequence
preferences.

5
00:00:10,645 --> 00:00:15,000
These are recorded results, not a new model
run.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,882
The saved trace shows what Meta actually
requested through MCP.

7
00:00:20,882 --> 00:00:25,588
It first requested target validation, then
sequence scoring.

8
00:00:25,588 --> 00:00:30,882
Code enforces constraints and ranking; ESM
supplies sequence preferences.

9
00:00:30,882 --> 00:00:35,000
Opening these records sends no new request.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,571
Compare the leading candidates without
changing

11
00:00:39,571 --> 00:00:42,586
their original scores or ranks.

12
00:00:42,586 --> 00:00:46,034
Select A32V and open Structure.

13
00:00:46,034 --> 00:00:50,050
The same candidate selection carries across

14
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:55,000
views, keeping the table and visualization
connected.

15
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,579
This is the public experimental reference,
not a predicted mutant.

16
00:01:01,579 --> 00:01:05,220
A32 has no atoms here, so BioPilot

17
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:10,789
shows sequence context without inventing a
location.

18
00:01:10,789 --> 00:01:14,737
Selecting S108 highlights author residue
seventy-seven.

19
00:01:14,737 --> 00:01:20,000
The three protected catalytic sites have
distinct colors.

20
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,052
Evidence records the structure source,

21
00:01:23,052 --> 00:01:26,667
chain, checksums, and residue
correspondence.

22
00:01:26,667 --> 00:01:32,667
Run provenance connects the displayed
candidates to saved computation.

23
00:01:32,667 --> 00:01:36,667
These checks support traceability, not
validated

24
00:01:36,667 --> 00:01:40,000
stability, activity, or binding changes.

25
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,750
New Review is a separate execution workflow.

26
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:49,107
It has three stages: input validation, agent
execution, and results.

27
00:01:49,107 --> 00:01:51,976
Unlike Saved Review, this surface can

28
00:01:51,976 --> 00:01:55,000
execute an explicitly approved request.

29
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,818
First, request S108A.

30
00:01:56,818 --> 00:02:00,332
The local guard refuses this protected-site

31
00:02:00,332 --> 00:02:04,091
substitution before sending any model
request.

32
00:02:04,091 --> 00:02:10,758
This is an actual input check, not a new
Meta decision.

33
00:02:10,758 --> 00:02:15,000
Protection itself does not prove retained
function.

34
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,308
Now enter A32V.

35
00:02:17,308 --> 00:02:23,462
Local validation prepares a review without
executing it.

36
00:02:23,462 --> 00:02:28,736
Confirmation shows full-reference positions,
the checkpoint,

37
00:02:28,736 --> 00:02:32,692
request limits, and unverified provider
cost.

38
00:02:32,692 --> 00:02:39,615
A new run requires arming, cost
acknowledgment, and Execute.

39
00:02:39,615 --> 00:02:45,000
We stop before execution in this recording.

40
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:49,138
Saved evidence and new execution remain
clearly separated.

41
00:02:49,138 --> 00:02:52,020
ESM preference is not experimental heat

42
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:55,345
tolerance or proof of biological
improvement.

43
00:02:55,345 --> 00:02:57,269
BioPilot makes candidate review

44
00:02:57,269 --> 00:03:00,000
inspectable while preserving human judgment.
